sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator
    participant RED as RED subagent
    participant GREEN as GREEN subagent
    participant VALIDATE as VALIDATE subagent
    participant Suite as Test suite (fresh process)
    participant Ledger as Per-epic ledger

    Orchestrator->>RED: Spawn for this slice
    RED->>RED: Write failing tests against the blind rubric's declared outcomes
    RED-->>Orchestrator: Failing tests committed

    Orchestrator->>GREEN: Spawn with failing tests
    GREEN->>GREEN: Write minimal code, never edit a test
    GREEN-->>Orchestrator: Implementation ready

    Orchestrator->>VALIDATE: Spawn to score the slice
    VALIDATE->>Suite: Execute the suite in a fresh process
    Suite-->>VALIDATE: Pass/fail results, no claimed result accepted
    VALIDATE->>VALIDATE: Read the code and the tests, judge adequacy against specs

    alt Score >= 0.90, no critical criterion below 1.0
        VALIDATE->>Ledger: Append per-criterion score and stated reason
        VALIDATE-->>Orchestrator: Slice accepted
    else Score below 0.90
        VALIDATE->>Ledger: Append per-criterion score and stated reason
        VALIDATE-->>Orchestrator: Return to GREEN with full feedback
        Orchestrator->>GREEN: Retry (up to 3 attempts total)
        Note over Orchestrator,GREEN: After 3 attempts, escalate to a human check-in
    else Rigged pass detected (edited/skipped/weakened test, swapped dependency, rubric read)
        VALIDATE->>Ledger: Append VOID and stated reason
        VALIDATE-->>Orchestrator: Void, no attempt cost
        Orchestrator->>RED: Return to RED to rewrite the tests
    end
